Z||000000||turbo86se||05-13-2001||12:53 AM||||Wow I thought this thing would never get done! But there she is! My bright yellow T-top '88 coupe with a 55K mile V6 is sitting in my driveway! I just took it for a quick spin for the first time. It is awesome! I love having my Fiero back! One headlight, no console or radio, no windshield wipers, I had to drive it! It accellerates very smoothly, it's louder than my SE.<BR>Did I mention I love having my coupe back? I'm going to wake up early tomorrow and install the V6 guages, SE dash, and extra guages.<BR>We still have to fix the one headlight, bleed the brakes once more, and something else!! <P>See you in Carlisle!! Who's going?  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||12
